  "description": "SIBHUI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H108 Er4 K2 O13,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.371-4.680 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.07-170.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er4K2O(OtBu)12]·C6H14.",
